# Fruits Landing Page

This repository contains my **Fruits Landing Page** developed as part of the **CodSoft Web Development Internship – Level 1 Task 2**.

## 📌 Project Overview
The project is a responsive landing page designed using HTML and CSS. It features a modern layout with a navigation bar, hero section, fruit cards, and footer.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3

## ✨ Features
- Responsive Design
- Modern User Interface
- Navigation Bar
- Hero Section
- Fruit Information Cards
- Attractive Color Palette
- Footer Section

## 🎯 Learning Outcomes
- Improved HTML and CSS skills
- Learned responsive web design
- Practiced layout design using Flexbox/Grid
- Enhanced UI design and styling

